= On the Boundaries of Knowledge

Every idea begins as a question. Writing gives that question a shape, and sharing it opens a conversation.

== A small mathematical note

The sum of the first $n$ positive integers can be written as:

$ sum_(i=1)^n i = (n(n + 1))/2 $

For example, the first five integers add up to $15$.

